# Series 8 — RFC-0013 Vulkan ABI audit + first-ever dispatch proof evidence
# x86_64 sandbox: SwiftShader ICD (Subzero JIT) via chrome-for-testing 156.0.8063.1
# generated: 2026-09-17T20:37:38Z

## AUDIT FINDINGS (vk_min.h vs Khronos Vulkan-Headers r362)

```
4 defect classes, all fixed in this series:
  1. 12 wrong constants (sType/enum/flag values; see vk_min.h audit block)
  2. VkShaderModuleCreateInfo_ missing flags field — ICD read codeSize as flags;
     experimentally confirmed: SwiftShader aborted with 'UNSUPPORTED
     pCreateInfo->flags 0x1544' where 0x1544=5444=exact byte size of
     validate_frame.spv
  3. VkPhysicalDeviceProperties_ was a 296-byte prefix view; every ICD writes
     824 bytes — 528-byte stack smash (-O0 segfault, -O2 silent)
  4. gpu_probe.c vkCreateComputePipelines called with createInfoCount=0 —
     pipelines were NEVER created; first vkCmdBindPipeline would bind NULL

WHY NEVER SEEN: the dispatch leg never executed on any evidence host —
llvmpipe's ~94 TiB JIT reservation fails on the sandbox AND all 100+ logged
ci-report gpu-native runs (every log shows allocation-leg-only, exit 4).
```

